        "id": "firenze",
        "title": "Florence 2024",
        "description": "Firenze (翡冷翠), a touristy town, but surprisingly home to some reasonably priced restaurants. After a late-night steak, I was walking back to the hotel when I looked up at the Florence Cathedral and suddenly found myself in tears. Later, I learned that this overwhelming excitement wasn’t unusual, it’s called Stendhal Syndrome, and fittingly, it originated right here in Florence.",
